                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Neeman's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Sustainable material innovation + comfort focus + Shark Tank amplification + premium-accessible positioning. Multi-dimensional advantage in commoditised footwear.</p>
                                        <h3>Can other sustainable footwear brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in material / positioning niching. Vegan-specific + specific-material specialty + regional-focus all create space.</p>
                                        <h3>Is sustainable footwear a real global opportunity?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — Allbirds + Rothy's + Veja international precedents. Sustainability tailwinds + material innovation combined create meaningful category.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest sustainable D2C lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Product substantiation + material story + education + international potential combined. Sustainability positioning requires real product truth.</p>
